Description: Modular analytics library for accounting systems
 DigestModules provides data collection modules that return structured JSON data
 for accounting system analytics. Features include:
 .
  - Core interfaces: ModuleInterface, DataProviderInterface
  - Abstract base classes for rapid module development
  - System-agnostic data providers (AbraFlexi, Pohoda, etc.)
  - Standardized module output format (JSON)
  - Built-in modules: OutcomingInvoices, Debtors
  - PSR-4 autoloading and comprehensive documentation
 .
 This library focuses only on data collection and analysis, not presentation.
 Use with DigestRenderer for HTML output generation.

